<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
  <title>403 - 网站暂不开放</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --text: #101828;
      --muted: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.66);
      --soft: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.48);
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      --line-strong: rgba(83, 109, 145, 0.2);
      --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      --accent: #3b82f6;
      --cyan: #7dd3fc;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html,
    body {
      min-height: 100%;
      margin: 0;
    }

    body {
      display: grid;
      min-height: 100vh;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 30px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 12%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.58), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 86% 18%, rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.7), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 62% 86%, rgba(209, 250, 229, 0.54), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, #f8fbff 0%, #eef6ff 48%, #f9fbff 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", "Segoe UI",
        "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif;
      animation: background-flow 16s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    body::before {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(62, 92, 130, 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(62, 92, 130, 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 56px 56px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, #000 0 42%, transparent 78%);
      content: "";
      animation: grid-drift 18s linear infinite;
    }

    body::after {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 0 28%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58) 38%, transparent 48%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 0 54%, rgba(201, 214, 232, 0.34) 100%);
      content: "";
      animation: light-sweep 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    .shell {
      position: relative;
      width: min(980px, 100%);
      min-height: min(620px, calc(100vh - 60px));
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
    }

    .aura {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 4% 10%;
      pointer-events: none;
      filter: blur(18px);
      opacity: 0.95;
      animation: aura-float 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    .aura::before,
    .aura::after {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5), transparent 16%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.36), rgba(155, 216, 255, 0.24));
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 0 36px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16),
        0 0 80px rgba(155, 216, 255, 0.1);
      content: "";
    }

    .aura::before {
      width: 390px;
      height: 220px;
      right: 4%;
      top: 3%;
      transform: rotate(-14deg);
      animation: blob-morph-a 9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .aura::after {
      width: 320px;
      height: 190px;
      left: 2%;
      bottom: 9%;
      transform: rotate(18deg);
      animation: blob-morph-b 10s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .ghost-code {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 50%;
      color: rgba(52, 86, 130, 0.07);
      font-size: clamp(170px, 31vw, 430px);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      line-height: 0.8;
      transform: translate(-50%, -52%);
      text-shadow: 0 20px 70px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
      user-select: none;
      animation: code-breathe 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .panel {
      position: relative;
      width: min(720px, 100%);
      padding: clamp(32px, 5.6vw, 62px);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 28px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34)),
        var(--glass);
      box-shadow:
        0 36px 110px rgba(64, 95, 132, 0.18),
        0 0 80px rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.12),
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94),
        inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42),
        inset 18px 18px 42px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.36),
        inset -22px -28px 46px rgba(83, 109, 145, 0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(34px) saturate(1.55);
      animation: panel-float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .panel::before {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 1px;
      pointer-events: none;
      border-radius: 27px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(112deg, transparent 0 18%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86) 29%, transparent 42%),
        linear-gradient(72deg, transparent 42%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.22), transparent 74%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58), transparent 34%);
      content: "";
      animation: glass-shift 4.8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    .panel::after {
      position: absolute;
      left: 22px;
      right: 22px;
      top: 0;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.72), transparent);
      content: "";
      animation: edge-glow 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .panel > * {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.46);
      color: var(--soft);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1;
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.42);
      content: "";
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 30px 0 18px;
      font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 78px);
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      line-height: 0.98;
    }

    p {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 19px);
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      margin: 34px 0 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--line-strong), transparent);
    }

    .meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .meta span {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.46);
      color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.68);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 650;
      line-height: 1;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.42);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      body {
        padding: 18px;
        overflow: auto;
      }

      .shell {
        min-height: calc(100vh - 36px);
      }

      .ghost-code {
        top: 34%;
        font-size: 160px;
      }

      .aura {
        display: none;
      }

      .panel {
        border-radius: 24px;
      }

      .panel::before {
        border-radius: 23px;
      }
    }

    @keyframes grid-drift {
      to {
        background-position: 56px 56px;
      }
    }

    @keyframes background-flow {
      from {
        background-position: 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 0;
        background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 100%;
      }

      to {
        background-position: -42px 26px, 36px -24px, -28px -34px, 0 0;
        background-size: 116% 116%, 112% 112%, 118% 118%, 100% 100%;
      }
    }

    @keyframes light-sweep {
      from {
        opacity: 0.72;
        transform: translate3d(-1.5%, -1%, 0);
      }

      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translate3d(1.5%, 1%, 0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes aura-float {
      from {
        transform: translate3d(-28px, 18px, 0) scale(0.96);
      }

      to {
        transform: translate3d(30px, -22px, 0) scale(1.06);
      }
    }

    @keyframes blob-morph-a {
      0%,
      100% {
        border-radius: 62% 38% 46% 54% / 48% 56% 44% 52%;
        transform: rotate(-14deg) translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      }

      50% {
        border-radius: 38% 62% 58% 42% / 56% 42% 58% 44%;
        transform: rotate(-7deg) translate3d(-26px, 18px, 0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes blob-morph-b {
      0%,
      100% {
        border-radius: 42% 58% 55% 45% / 52% 42% 58% 48%;
        transform: rotate(18deg) translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      }

      50% {
        border-radius: 58% 42% 38% 62% / 44% 58% 42% 56%;
        transform: rotate(10deg) translate3d(24px, -20px, 0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes code-breathe {
      0%,
      100% {
        opacity: 0.82;
        transform: translate(-50%, -52%) scale(1);
      }

      50% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translate(-50%, -52%) scale(1.018);
      }
    }

    @keyframes panel-float {
      0%,
      100% {
        transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      }

      50% {
        transform: translate3d(0, -8px, 0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes glass-shift {
      from {
        opacity: 0.45;
        transform: translate3d(-14%, -4%, 0);
      }

      to {
        opacity: 0.95;
        transform: translate3d(14%, 4%, 0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes edge-glow {
      0%,
      100% {
        opacity: 0.38;
      }

      50% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="shell" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="aura" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ghost-code" aria-hidden="true">403</div>
    <section class="panel" aria-label="访问状态">
      <div class="eyebrow">Access Temporarily Closed</div>
      <h1 id="page-title">网站升级中</h1>
      <p>为提供更稳定、安全的服务体验，网站正在进行公司内部升级。升级期间暂不对外开放，完成后将第一时间恢复访问。</p>
      <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="meta" aria-label="原因和建议">
        <span>403 访问受限</span>
        <span>内部升级维护</span>
        <span>请稍后访问</span>
      </div>
      <footer>如需了解恢复时间，请联系网站负责人或相关服务人员。</footer>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
